  "releaseNotes": "Refund a payment at its gateway and give back only what it moved on the balance\nMove the admin from Blazor to Razor Pages at the repository root\nStop the admin from calling an AI provider directly\nCharge AI generations at the prices of the provider that produced them\nRequire a balance movement's type\nRecord what moved a balance and move it once per operation\nOffer a plugin the version its tariff covers and its program can load\nOffer the version a product can actually load, and a group for the connectors everyone has\nLet the admin open the whole site's AI conversations, and count them on a client\nCharge every AI generation, and say what it paid for\nLet a menu item stand for a catalog section, and say where a link opens\nTell a payer what happened to their payment\nPoint the registration form at the real terms and privacy pages\nBound what the log keeps, and cut every value where it is written\nTake a conversation's fields as arguments, not as an object\nLet a plan's iteration counts be set instead of deployed\nAnswer a visitor on a public page, and help them write an order\nStop the database growing on what nobody reads\nUpdated Ecng.Licensing to 1.0.89.\nUpdated Ecng.Net to 1.0.544.\nUpdated StockSharp.Messages to 5.0.250.",
